        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgba(83,97,116,1)" textAlign="left"><p>CLI误检测到不存在的ghost@6.62.0，--version参数无效</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" textAlign="left"><p>手动下载Ghost 5.130.6 tgz解压安装，建立current junction</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="60">
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" bold="true" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" textAlign="center"><p>2</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" textAlign="left"><p>sqlite3编译失败</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" color="rgba(83,97,116,1)" textAlign="left"><p>系统无Visual Studio，sqlite3源码编译失败</p></content></td>
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" textAlign="left"><p>从GitHub releases下载预编译二进制，手动放置到build/Release</p></content></td>
      </tr>
      <tr height="60">
        <td><content textType="body" fontSize="11" bold="true" color="rgba(37,99,235,1)" textAlign="center"><p>3</p></content></td>
